        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-020498",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our commercial potential could be reduced or eliminated if our competitors develop and commercialize products that are safer, more effective, have fewer or less severe side effects, are more convenient or are less expensive than products that we may develop.",
        "start_character": 35272,
        "end_character": 35530
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-020498",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-020498-1edffd1da55667de",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-020498",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our competitors also may obtain FDA or other regulatory approval for their products more rapidly than we may obtain approval for ours, which could result in our competitors establishing a strong market position before we are able to enter the market or make our development more complicated.",
        "start_character": 35531,
        "end_character": 35822
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-020498",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-020498-1edffd1da55667de",
